      "comment": "DRAGON SONG (7) gets the nod after a sound third in a BM65 at Gordonvale, where she was beaten a length and a half and again showed she is racing well. Her record at around 1500m is solid and she has already placed at this venue. Has claims. DEAL AN ACE (4) brings the most reliable body of recent form, with a BM65 second at Ewan and a proven 1500m record, though he has been more consistent for placings than wins in the past year. CYCLONE COCO (3) won a Class 4 at Ewan and has the winning rider back, but he now comes away from picnic grade and has to repeat the effort on this track. MISTERKIPCHOGE (2) was poor at Townsville after missing the start, yet his nose second in a Class 2 at Bowen keeps him in the mix as a place danger.",
